    "description": "Time Is Out Of Mind is a captivating documentary series that chronicles an 18-month deployment at the Rothera Research Station, providing a rare and immersive look into life and work on the frozen continent. Narrated by the station's crew, the film offers an intimate perspective on the groundbreaking scientific research and day to day life in one of the planet's most remote and extreme environments.",
